*> vybe-test: cobol/level88_transition/level88_in_and_condition
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_level88_transition.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 STATUS PIC X VALUE "Y".
    88 ENABLED VALUE "Y".
01 COUNT PIC 9 VALUE 5.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    IF ENABLED AND COUNT > 0
        DISPLAY "ACTIVE-AND-NONZERO"
    ELSE
        DISPLAY "NO"
    END-IF.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING "ACTIVE-AND-NONZERO" DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "ACTIVE-AND-NONZERO"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [ACTIVE-AND-NONZERO] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

